# Red team review (required before completion)

Before marking implementation work **done**, moving tickets to `board/done/`, or
calling a PR merge-ready, you **must** run the red-team review gate:

→ `.cursor/skills/red-team-review/SKILL.md`

Also encoded in `.ai-instructions.md` step 11 and `.cursor/skills/delivery-standards/SKILL.md`.

## Non-negotiables

1. Diff the real code (not only the PR summary).
2. Post a PR review with marker `<!-- red-team-review -->`.
3. Fix every **Blocking** finding; re-run lint/tests/build after fixes.
4. Report the red-team verdict in your completion summary.
5. Applies to **your own** PRs too — no self-exemption.

Skip only for pure docs typo fixes, or when the user explicitly waives the review.
